      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The clinician should recognize the importance of screening examinations for all patients seen in the dental office. The elements of a brief screening history and examination have been reviewed. In addition, the indications and elements of a comprehensive history and examination have been described. A discussion of current opinion on available diagnostic testing was also presented."},
